   2:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
   3:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   * @file    stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c
   4:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   * @author  MCD Application Team
   5:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   * @brief   CORTEX HAL module driver.
   6:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *          This file provides firmware functions to manage the following 
   7:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *          functionalities of the CORTEX:
   8:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *           + Initialization and de-initialization functions
   9:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *           + Peripheral Control functions 
  10:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   *
  11:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   @verbatim  
  12:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  13:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****                         ##### How to use this driver #####
  14:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  15:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  16:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]  
  17:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Interrupts using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  18:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ===========================================================
  19:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]     
  20:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     This section provides functions allowing to configure the NVIC interrupts (IRQ).
  21:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     The Cortex-M4 exceptions are managed by CMSIS functions.
  22:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****    
  23:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the NVIC Priority Grouping using HAL_NVIC_SetPriorityGrouping()
  24:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         function according to the following table.
  25:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Configure the priority of the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(). 
  26:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) Enable the selected IRQ Channels using HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ().
  27:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     (#) please refer to programming manual for details in how to configure priority. 
  28:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****       
  29:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- When the NVIC_PRIORITYGROUP_0 is selected, IRQ preemption is no more possible. 
  30:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****          The pending IRQ priority will be managed only by the sub priority.
  31:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****    
  32:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****      -@- IRQ priority order (sorted by highest to lowest priority):
  33:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest preemption priority
  34:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest sub priority
  35:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (+@) Lowest hardware priority (IRQ number)
  36:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****  
  37:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]  
  38:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     *** How to configure Systick using CORTEX HAL driver ***
  39:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     ========================================================
  40:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     [..]
  41:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     Setup SysTick Timer for time base.
  42:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****            
  43:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) The HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function calls the SysTick_Config() function which
  44:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        is a CMSIS function that:
  45:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Reload register with value passed as function parameter.
  46:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick IRQ priority to the lowest value (0x0F).
  47:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Resets the SysTick Counter register.
  48:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Configures the SysTick Counter clock source to be Core Clock Source (HCLK).
  49:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Enables the SysTick Interrupt.
  50:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****         (++) Starts the SysTick Counter.
  51:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****     
  52:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick Clock source to be HCLK_Div8 by calling the macro
  53:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG(SYSTICK_CLKSOURCE_HCLK_DIV8) just after the
  54:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function call. The __HAL_CORTEX_SYSTICKCLK_CONFIG() macro is defined
  55:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        inside the stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.h file.
  56:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  57:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) You can change the SysTick IRQ priority by calling the
  58:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        HAL_NVIC_SetPriority(SysTick_IRQn,...) function just after the HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  59:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        call. The HAL_NVIC_SetPriority() call the NVIC_SetPriority() function which is a CMSIS funct
  60:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c **** 
  61:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****    (+) To adjust the SysTick time base, use the following formula:
  62:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****                             
  63:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        Reload Value = SysTick Counter Clock (Hz) x  Desired Time base (s)
  64:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value is the parameter to be passed for HAL_SYSTICK_Config() function
  65:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****        (++) Reload Value should not exceed 0xFFFFFF
  66:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****    
  67:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   @endverbatim
  68:./src/stm32f7xx_hal_cortex.c ****   ******************************************************************************
